Project Demo Planning
1. Introduction

Introduce the project title, team members, and project objective.

2. Problem Statement

Explain the need for secure and controlled access to institution records.

3. Proposed Solution

Explain the Script-Controlled ACL approach.

4. Implementation Demonstration

Demonstrate:

User creation
Role creation
Table creation
ACL configuration
Record access
5. Testing Demonstration

Demonstrate READ, CREATE, WRITE, DELETE, unauthorized access, and administrator access.

6. Project Result

Show the final access-control behavior of the system.

7. Conclusion

Summarize how the project addresses the identified security requirement.
